Route45_EventScript_Hiker1_Text:
	.string "New blaze every spring. The old\nones go grey and people miss\nthe turn.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker2_Text:
	.string "You're going down? Sensible.\nI came up in the dark and I'd\nlike that on the record.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker3_Text:
	.string "The culvert washed out below\nthe third bend. Mind the\nshovel.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker4_Text:
	.string "I paint the cairns. The pass\nis clear today, if that's what\nyou're asking.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker5_Text:
	.string "They come off the plateau\nsmelling of cave and wanting\nwater. Barrel's behind me.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker6_Text:
	.string "The descent is the reward.\nThat's what I tell my knees.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker7_Text:
	.string "If you're heading for ROUTE 46,\ndon't take the short grass.\nThere's a nest in it.$"

Route45_EventScript_Hiker8_Text:
	.string "My grandfather walked this\nroad before the gate opened.\nHe says it was quieter.$"
